  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> and has foci at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the tangent to this hyperbola at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;also passes through the point"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
